{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10017_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca0aeea9eeb1790a630774ee954c59d68206b50904422607475782d4b87ab902",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ab1102babc1298c890650e808961091c3646ca7d54e2dc5d290de42873134ca",
      "text": "喂，辛苦了。\n想着稍微找你聊两句。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a917777ed7982a8ebb02bb6c6770f5ae5a27e10579d0b30264ff70cb1dc3f55",
      "text": "关于这次的工作啊……分在一起的成员，\n要么年纪比我小，要么就是哪里迷迷糊糊的对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44550637dfbea039c0fa33c9fbe97c77fcd9e7d5bf466f9dcbf838d711bc4ff3",
      "text": "所以和在Beit的时候完全不一样啊。\n啊，我是指好的方面……受到了不少启发。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b69ae20df9485786658c8f844e39cc7b2e455bc095ac76c59bec1f4cb341d6d",
      "text": "我也试着用自己的方式去照顾大家、统领大家了……\n但不知道自己做得好不好啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000036:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:269ac3b7fd40f2ec117f97a60bba14e6b2cd547e6c4a47d097f72b99d197cf88",
      "text": "平时总是能自然而然把大家凝聚起来的实先生，\n原来真的很厉害啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000038:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5f1eaf6f7b4234bdbe8ecd68ee8d9442112baef2b4e15411585db8547c4142d",
      "text": "恭二先生也\n很可靠哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000041:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0e74a67cd885f9c419cc67391b517ddb8c895542d62e16aff3eb3d7f0a4458d",
      "text": "是吗？\n既然你都这么说了，那或许真的是这样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000043:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b102879c8960b5e66e8175db2d90de904b9838257d9fed3abfde95690b4383c",
      "text": "不过，下次为了能做得更好，我会继续努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000045:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01fc425ad78b67180b5546b0241906714ba4aba1120d8473e30ccabcac1610ab",
      "text": "那么，下次碰头时再见了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000058:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b444bafc68f25659e0fe320c39e2d36bb20fec3d49c513abdf3aad9b9d42394",
      "text": "广告拍摄当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d81781a5c716d6b99ece6313ca0fe5daf8ea4bb1af8937b66c1865a592411d9e",
      "text": "“情人节快乐。\n我拼尽全力的心意……希望能被你收下”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1744c00d67caa342506c5bad14a858b293e1561264759c919e9e2de03f175378",
      "text": "“这个，送给你……\n即使是无法实现的恋情，也想传达给你……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad3a8df60c2d30d15754185a7384f36da5aecf273c97b2854790109b7f1a7dcf",
      "text": "“今天，是情人节吧？\n别跟我这种人一起过啊……会让我产生误会的”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65efec64da45501d22b73f66c849152ec6879f497071fe54f12dd6dbcaf5134c",
      "text": "“这份巧克力，是我的心意。\n哪怕只有一小块能够传达给你，我也很开心”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc68adc7197afa017b6d0ace39cc9ab96477d0fd0c62c74458411570bb0d173e",
      "text": "“即使无法传达给重要的你”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93d26642c10b603b4b1cc6d45ea46dd02a6aa38711cb1542c55281f27b6c2919",
      "text": "“这份甜蜜，也将慰藉我的心”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_j:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2229d1264d9fd03dd47383bcc8659d6bbdb3ae04ec36c3ba58571d3d82618b4c",
      "text": "“……短剧完整版\n正在本网站公开中！此外，在限定期间内……”",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
